    92	  formal PIT over `R_N` (Agrawal–Biswas 2003, Thm 4.8; Arvind–Mukhopadhyay–Srinivasan, arXiv:0801.0514 §6) reaches a support
    93	  index `i`, and `1 < gcd(i, N) < N` (seed lemma L2). Zero testing is not the obstacle: for odd balanced semiprimes, the sections
