   165	| L5 | `F_N ≡ 0` as a function on `R_N` ⇔ `N` prime or Carmichael | proved | `seed_lemmas.md` L5 |
   410	(2) the C-2R package (reflection criterion, character-fold mechanism, squaring-exponent theorem, Conjecture C2R-X);
   411	(3) the identification of the second informative bit of `φ(N) mod 2^k` with the 4-rank criterion, as an interface to
